    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d615-a1">

                <pb facs="0603" n="529" xml:id="pg529"/>

                <head>[Translation.—Circular telegram.]</head>

                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-04-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 27, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>President Lincoln has been assassinated. Vice-President Johnson has taken
                    possession of the presidency.</p>
                <p>This legation wears mourning for thirty days.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY, <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
